[85.746407, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ selectors parse key=value \u001b[90m(1.515088ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ resources group by branch tag \u001b[90m(0.25078ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary warns about untagged resources \u001b[90m(0.361766ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan includes untagged resources created by the branch's stack \u001b[90m(0.369636ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan deletes dependents before the resources they depend on \u001b[90m(0.373497ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan selects exact branch tags or stack IDs, not names or prefixes \u001b[90m(0.193966ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ deletion order handles shuffled graphs, shared dependencies and missing prerequisites \u001b[90m(0.706214ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ external dependents block stack-owned resources without being selected \u001b[90m(0.183793ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[85.74866, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ cycles fail planning instead of returning an unsafe deletion order \u001b[90m(0.528342ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
